a attributes, e.g. `data-node-id=\"1:2\"`."},{"type":"text","text":"Image assets are stored on a localhost server. Clients can use these images directly in code as a way to view the image assets the same way they would other remote servers. Images and SVGs will be stored as constants, e.g. const image = 'http://localhost:3845/assets/10c13ac1a228a365cb98a0064b1d5afbc84887b2.png' These constants will be used in the code as the source for the image, e.g. <img src={image} /> This is true for both images and SVGs, so you can use the same approach for both types of assets."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}]},"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":10}
